      <h1 class="jr-h1">Does Collagen Help Stretch Marks? What No Trial Has Measured</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Search this question and almost every answer is written by someone selling collagen, and at least one of them puts a percentage on the benefit. Here is what has actually been measured, what the randomised evidence supports for marks you already have, and where an oral collagen shot honestly sits.</p>

